  <!-- TIPS -->
  <section id="tips">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-label">Buenas practicas</div>
      <h2 class="section-title">8 habitos que te protegen</h2>
      <p class="section-sub">Cambios simples pero de alto impacto, ordenados por el nivel de proteccion que aportan.</p>

      <div class="tips-grid">
        <div class="tip-card">
          <div class="tip-number">01</div>
          <h3>Use a password manager</h3>
          <p>Never reuse passwords. A password manager generates and stores unique, complex passwords for every site automatically.</p>
          <div class="tip-bar"><div class="tip-bar-fill" style="width:95%;background:#3b6d11;"></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="tip-card">
          <div class="tip-number">02</div>
          <h3>Enable two-factor auth</h3>
          <p>Even if your password is stolen, 2FA stops attackers cold. Use an authenticator app rather than SMS when possible.</p>
          <div class="tip-bar"><div class="tip-bar-fill" style="width:92%;background:#3b6d11;"></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="tip-card">
          <div class="tip-number">03</div>
          <h3>Keep software updated</h3>
          <p>Most attacks exploit known vulnerabilities. Updates patch these holes before attackers can use them against you.</p>
          <div class="tip-bar"><div class="tip-bar-fill" style="width:88%;background:#639922;"></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="tip-card">
          <div class="tip-number">04</div>
          <h3>Back up your data</h3>
          <p>Follow the 3-2-1 rule: 3 copies, 2 different media types, 1 offsite backup. This defeats ransomware completely.</p>
          <div class="tip-bar"><div class="tip-bar-fill" style="width:85%;background:#639922;"></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="tip-card">
          <div class="tip-number">05</div>
          <h3>Verify links before clicking</h3>
          <p>Hover over links to see the real URL. Phishing sites mimic trusted domains with subtle differences like paypa1.com.</p>
          <div class="tip-bar"><div class="tip-bar-fill" style="width:80%;background:#ba7517;"></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="tip-card">
          <div class="tip-number">06</div>
          <h3>Use HTTPS everywhere</h3>
          <p>Always check for the padlock icon. Avoid entering sensitive data on HTTP sites — your data travels unencrypted.</p>
          <div class="tip-bar"><div class="tip-bar-fill" style="width:75%;background:#ba7517;"></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="tip-card">
          <div class="tip-number">07</div>
          <h3>Use a VPN on public Wi-Fi</h3>
          <p>Public networks are hunting grounds for attackers. A VPN encrypts all your traffic, blocking interception attempts.</p>
          <div class="tip-bar"><div class="tip-bar-fill" style="width:70%;background:#ba7517;"></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="tip-card">
          <div class="tip-number">08</div>
          <h3>Audit app permissions</h3>
          <p>Regularly review which apps can access your camera, microphone, location, and contacts. Revoke what you don't need.</p>
          <div class="tip-bar"><div class="tip-bar-fill" style="width:65%;background:#854f0b;"></div></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- PASSWORD TESTER -->
  <section id="password">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-label">Analizador de contraseñas</div>
      <h2 class="section-title">Que tan fuerte es tu contraseña?</h2>
      <p class="section-sub">Evalua la fuerza de tu contraseña en tiempo real y entiende que la hace debil o fuerte.</p>

      <div class="pw-wrapper">
        <div class="pw-tester">
          <h3>// analizador_fuerza_contraseña</h3>
          <div class="input-group">
            <label>Introduce una contraseña para probar</label>
            <input class="cyber-input" type="password" id="pw-input" placeholder="Escribe aqui..." oninput="testPassword(this.value)" autocomplete="off" />
          </div>
          <div class="pw-bar-bg"><div class="pw-bar-fill" id="pw-bar" style="width:0%;background:#e24b4a;"></div></div>
          <div class="pw-meta">
            <span class="pw-strength-lbl" id="pw-strength" style="color:#64748b;">—</span>
            <span class="pw-entropy-lbl" id="pw-entropy"></span>
          </div>
          <div class="pw-criteria">
            <div class="criterion" id="c-len"><div class="criterion-dot" id="d-len"></div>12+ characters</div>
            <div class="criterion" id="c-upper"><div class="criterion-dot" id="d-upper"></div>Uppercase letters</div>
            <div class="criterion" id="c-lower"><div class="criterion-dot" id="d-lower"></div>Lowercase letters</div>
            <div class="criterion" id="c-num"><div class="criterion-dot" id="d-num"></div>Numbers</div>
            <div class="criterion" id="c-sym"><div class="criterion-dot" id="d-sym"></div>Symbols (!@#$...)</div>
            <div class="criterion" id="c-rep"><div class="criterion-dot" id="d-rep"></div>No repeated characters</div>
          </div>
          <div class="pw-suggestions" id="pw-suggestions"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="pw-info">
          <div class="pw-rule-card">
            <h4>Why length matters most</h4>
            <p>Each extra character multiplies the time to crack exponentially. An 8-character password can be cracked in hours; a 16-character one takes centuries — even with modern GPUs.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="pw-rule-card">
            <h4>Avoid predictable patterns</h4>
            <p>Attackers use wordlists and rules that try common substitutions (@ for a, 3 for e, ! at the end). P@ssw0rd! is no safer than Password to modern cracking tools.</p>
          </div>
          <div style="font-size:11px;color:var(--text-muted);margin-bottom:8px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.08em;">Example passwords</div>
          <div class="pw-examples">
            <div class="pw-example"><code>password2024!</code><span class="pw-ex-tag tag-bad">Weak</span></div>
            <div class="pw-example"><code>Tr0ub4d0r&3</code><span class="pw-ex-tag tag-ok">Fair</span></div>
            <div class="pw-example"><code>Qx#9mL!vKp2$Wr</code><span class="pw-ex-tag tag-good">Strong</span></div>
            <div class="pw-example"><code>correct-horse-battery-staple</code><span class="pw-ex-tag tag-good">Strong</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

